-1 MOZM2~


{117}Authors' tips and thoughs{300}...



	Well, if you come this far to read this, we would be more than glad
to give you some tips(and our opinions) as a bonus. However, to what extend
these tips are true, it's for you to judge as you are ultimately responsible
for yourself. :)

     1. NEVER make the mistake of "k"ing anything you see as this is
        probably the last command you'll ever type. :)
     2. TRY not to cheat while doing quests. You'll find out why. :)
     3. Nothing of value is free in this world. Please don't form a 
        group of 50 people and start banzai mobs for valuable eqs. We
        value your time and effort, if not you and your friends' 
        continual health. :)
     4. Be observant. We spent considerable amount of time on 
        minute details for your sake. So we only ask that you do the
        same for us. :)
     5. Try not to abuse the mobs loaded by the objects to level. 
        All of them have very interesting fight prog.
        Listen carefully to what they say as their language is bad and
        you will have to understand this new form of language :)
        In addition, please be patient on what they are trying to tell
        you. Don't worry about sitting around where ever to wait for the
        mobs to finish what they're trying to tell you. It's only 30
        minutes of waiting time on average(this is part of the feature
        cos old people, like the abbot, has trouble speaking fluently).


       {135}(C){300} {117}IMPORTANT INFO{300}...
       {135}(D){300} {117}Credits{300}...


   
{c}MOZM3
{d}MOZM4
