#27901
Abbot~
Abbot YatTang~
An Abbot of this monastery is here.~
You can tell from the looks of him that he is a man of great knowledge
and spirit. His presence makes you feel safe and secure. Like every
monk you see in this monastery, he always greet you courteously and
smiled benevolently whenever you approached him. From the look of
his eyes, you can tell that he will not hesitate to answer any questions
you ask. He is currently meditating, kneeling on top of a golden lotus
dais. In his hands, held a bead necklace, where he kept chanting
something that's beyond your understanding. (My English is bad)~
