#27902
Monk~
the monk~
A monk is here sweeping diligently.~
From a glance, you can tell that this is just an ordinary monk.
However, you notice that despite doing simple chores such as
sweeping, this monk seemed to be in total concentration of his job.
Not until you tap on his shoulder that he knew that you are there.
He smiled at you broadly and bow before you. He wish your journey to be 
fruitful and success in whatever you do. With that he went back to
concentrate on his sweeping again. (My English is bad)~
